  "text": "Umbral gnome scouts patrol the tunnels that lead into their settlements. They make use of the darkness of these tunnels to hide from any would-be trespassers. While umbral gnome scouts prefer to use their stealth for reconnaissance, they aren't afraid to strike from the shadows to deal with threats. They are adept at moving between areas of darkness for hit-and-run tactics."
